  "title": "Queensland's Olympic Stadium Concept Plans and Rural Road Investment",
  "summary": "Queensland's plans for a new Olympic stadium precinct to surround Brisbane's Victoria Park, as well as India's efforts to expand rural road connectivity, highlight a mix of sporting and infrastructure initiatives.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Queensland government has released new concept images for a parkland precinct to surround the 2032 Olympic stadium, aiming to address concerns about lack of detail in the concept.",
      "confidence": 0.95
