    {
      "title": "Queensland reveals concept plans for Brisbane Olympic stadium precinct – but critics say they are ‘fantasy vision’",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/aug/02/queensland-reveals-concept-plans-for-brisbane-olympic-stadium-precinct-but-critics-say-they-are-fantasy-vision",
      "description": "<p>David Crisafulli says ‘Queenslanders will enjoy for generations’ as opponents point to lack of detail</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The Queensland government has released new concept images for a parkland precinct to surround the 2032 Olympic stadium, as it seeks to quell concern at the loss of Brisbane’s largest inner-city parkland.</p><p>But opponents of the plans – now entering the early construction phase – to build a stadium at Brisbane’s Victoria Park say the concept images are a “fantasy vision” with no detail, and which overlook the likely need for carparks, roads, transport links and plazas to accommodate large crowds.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/aug/02/queensland-reveals-concept-plans-for-brisbane-olympic-stadium-precinct-but-critics-say-they-are-fantasy-vision\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-02T06:40:41"
    },
    {
      "title": "EVs and hybrids approach half of Australian new car sales amid ongoing fuel crisis",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/02/ev-hybrids-almost-half-australian-new-car-sales-april-june-fuel-crisis",
      "description": "<p>Australians bought EVs and hybrids at nearly same rate as petrol cars between April and June, Australian Automobile Association data shows</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Australians are now buying electric and hybrid vehicles at the same rate as traditional petrol-powered cars, according to new data that shows EV sales doubled in the months after the peak of the fuel price spike.</p><p>Fuel prices are again <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/01/petrol-prices-on-track-to-top-2-a-litre-as-bowen-sounds-death-knell-for-fuel-excise-relief\">on track to top $2 a litre</a>, after the federal government’s fuel excise reductions – introduced to offset the impact of the ongoing crisis in the Middle East – come to an end on Sunday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/02/ev-hybrids-almost-half-australian-new-car-sales-april-june-fuel-crisis\">Continue reading...</a>",
